+## Naglis setup
+
+Do changes, commit locally, but no pushing. Save the diff in a file and if needed - just clone the repo and apply the changes from that file.
+
+```bash
+git diff 4e5e78a HEAD > /home/home/Desktop/DONT_DELETE_2/__learn-lean/love2024.diff
+cd /home/home/Desktop/DONT_DELETE_2/__learn-lean/ && git add . && git commit -m "love2024 changes" && git push
+git reset 4e5e78a --hard
+git apply /home/home/Desktop/DONT_DELETE_2/__learn-lean/love2024.diff
+```
